{"id":"menschlich","lemma":"menschlich","pos":"adj","rank":1743,"glosses":["human, manlike","humane, kind"],"ipa":"/mɛnʃlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/25/De-menschlich.ogg/De-menschlich.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"menschlicher","superlative":"am menschlichsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin menschlich.","en":"I am human.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41493","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Dieser Hund ist fast menschlich.","en":"This dog is almost human.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"almost"},null]},{"text":"Fehler zu machen, macht uns menschlich.","en":"Making mistakes is what makes us human.","words":[{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to make"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind menschlich.","en":"We're human.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ein menschlicher Körper besteht aus unzähligen Zellen.","en":"A human body consists of a countless number of cells.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"body"},{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"countless, innumerable","l":"unzählig"},{"g":"in a monastery or…","l":"Zelle"}]}]}